---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
export const prerender = false;
---
<html lang="en-GB"><head><BaseHead title="Create a work pack | SafeWork AI" description="Prepare and pay for a job-specific SafeWork AI draft work pack." /></head><body class="safework-office"><Header/><main class="workspace"><a href="/health-and-safety">← Health &amp; Safety</a><p class="eyebrow">SAFEWORK AI / WORK PACKS</p><h1>Create your work pack</h1><p>Complete the job form, check the details and pay securely. SafeWork starts preparing the pack only after Stripe confirms payment.</p><ol class="purchase-steps" aria-label="Purchase process"><li><strong>1</strong><span>Fill in the form</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Review and pay</span></li><li><strong>3</strong><span>Generate and download</span></li></ol><div class="payment-notice"><strong>Nothing is generated before payment.</strong><span>You can review and edit every detail before opening Stripe.</span></div><div class="layout"><form id="pack-form"><h2>Tell us about the company and job</h2><label>Company name<input name="company" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="organization" /></label><label>Company address <span>(optional)</span><input name="companyAddress" maxlength="500" /></label><label>Contact telephone <span>(optional)</span><input name="contact" maxlength="200" type="tel" /></label><label>Job description<textarea name="description" required minlength="8" maxlength="12000" rows="8" placeholder="Describe the work, workforce, tools, materials, access and known site conditions."></textarea></label><label>Job address<textarea name="address" required minlength="5" maxlength="500" rows="2"></textarea></label><label>Confirmed emergency arrangements <span>(optional)</span><textarea name="emergency" maxlength="1500" rows="4" placeholder="Site emergency contact and telephone, first aider, nearest hospital and any other confirmed arrangements. Leave unknown details blank."></textarea></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewAccepted" required/>I understand this is an AI-generated draft that must be checked by a competent person before use.</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="processingAccepted" required/>I agree to send these job details to OpenAI to prepare the pack and store the order with Trades Go Digital. I will not include unnecessary personal or sensitive information.</label><button id="review" type="submit" disabled>Review details and price →</button></form><aside><p class="aside-tag">WHAT YOU RECEIVE</p><h2>Your work pack</h2><ul><li>Company-branded draft</li><li>Method statement and work sequence</li><li>Risk assessment and controls</li><li>Relevant COSHH assessments</li><li>Emergency and briefing records</li><li>Applicable supporting forms</li><li>A4 document download and repeat access</li></ul><p id="price">Checking availability…</p><p>No subscription. One purchase covers one job description.</p><div class="locked-pack"><strong>Pack generation locked</strong><span>Unlocked automatically after confirmed payment.</span></div></aside></div><section id="confirmation" hidden><p class="eyebrow">STEP 2 / REVIEW AND PAY</p><h2>Check your details before payment</h2><pre id="summary"></pre><p id="total"></p><p>Your pack will be generated after Stripe confirms payment. If generation is interrupted, the private order link lets you retry without paying again.</p><button id="pay">Pay securely with Stripe →</button> <button id="edit" class="secondary">Edit details</button></section><p role="status" id="message"></p><section id="recovery" hidden><h2>Your order is saved</h2><p>Save this private link so you can return to the paid order and download. Anyone with the link can access the pack.</p><a id="order-link">Open / save private order link</a><p><a id="stripe-link" class="button">Pay securely with Stripe →</a></p></section></main><Footer/></body></html>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#pack-form')!;
const msg=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#message')!;
const review=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#review')!;
const confirmation=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#confirmation')!;
const pay=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#pay')!;
const workerCountField=document.createElement('label');workerCountField.className='worker-count-field';workerCountField.innerHTML='Number of workers<input name="workerCount" type="number" min="1" max="50" step="1" value="1" required inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="worker-count-help"><small id="worker-count-help">The pack creates one qualification and training-expiry form for each worker.</small>';form.querySelector('textarea[name="description"]')?.closest('label')?.before(workerCountField);
const planningFields=document.createElement('fieldset');planningFields.className='planning-fields';planningFields.innerHTML=`<legend>Job-planning questions</legend><p>Tick everything that applies. Use the short detail boxes only where the pack needs a name or job-specific information.</p>
<section class="planning-group"><h3>Work area, boundaries and access</h3><div class="tick-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="boundaryAccess" value="Client or dutyholder approval confirmed"> Client or dutyholder approval confirmed</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="boundaryAccess" value="Work boundaries agreed"> Work boundaries agreed</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="boundaryAccess" value="Access and deliveries agreed"> Access and deliveries agreed</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="boundaryAccess" value="Public protection arranged"> Public protection arranged</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="boundaryAccess" value="Traffic or lane controls required"> Traffic or lane controls required</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="boundaryAccess" value="Not applicable"> Not applicable</label></div><input name="boundaryAccessDetails" maxlength="500" placeholder="Who approved it, restrictions or other access details (optional)"></section>
<section class="planning-group"><h3>Service and ground checks</h3><div class="tick-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="servicesGround" value="Underground service plans reviewed"> Service plans reviewed</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="servicesGround" value="Work area scanned for services"> Area scanned for services</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="servicesGround" value="Services marked on the ground"> Services marked</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="servicesGround" value="Ground conditions checked"> Ground checked</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="servicesGround" value="Trial holes required"> Trial holes required</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="servicesGround" value="No excavation or ground disturbance"> No excavation / ground disturbance</label></div><input name="servicesGroundDetails" maxlength="500" placeholder="Scan results, drawing references or ground details (optional)"></section>
<section class="planning-group permit-group"><h3>Permits and authorisations</h3><details class="permit-picker"><summary>Select every permit needed</summary><div class="permit-options"><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="No permit required"> No permit required</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Permit to excavate / break ground"> Excavation / break ground</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Hot works permit"> Hot works</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Electrical isolation permit"> Electrical isolation</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Work at height permit"> Work at height</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Confined space permit"> Confined space</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Lifting operations permit"> Lifting operations</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Road space / lane closure permit"> Road space / lane closure</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Airport permit"> Airport permit</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="permits" value="Client or site-specific permit"> Client / site-specific permit</label></div></details><p class="selection-note" data-permit-selection>No permits selected</p><input name="permitDetails" maxlength="500" placeholder="Who will issue the permits or other permit details (optional)"></section>
<section class="planning-group"><h3>Workers, competence and supervision</h3><div class="tick-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="peopleRoles" value="Supervisor appointed"> Supervisor</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="peopleRoles" value="First aider appointed"> First aider</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="peopleRoles" value="Plant operator required"> Plant operator</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="peopleRoles" value="Traffic marshal required"> Traffic marshal</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="peopleRoles" value="Fire watch required"> Fire watch</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="peopleRoles" value="Banksman / signaller required"> Banksman / signaller</label></div><input name="peopleRolesDetails" maxlength="500" placeholder="Names, roles, qualifications or supervision details (optional)"></section>
<section class="planning-group"><h3>Plant, tools, materials and products</h3><div class="tick-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Hand tools"> Hand tools</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Power tools"> Power tools</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Plant or machinery"> Plant / machinery</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Access equipment"> Access equipment</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Concrete or cement products"> Concrete / cement</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Chemicals or hazardous products"> Chemicals / hazardous products</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Lifting equipment"> Lifting equipment</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="plantMaterials" value="Not applicable"> Not applicable</label></div><input name="plantMaterialsDetails" maxlength="700" placeholder="Equipment, product names, SDS or inspection details (optional)"></section>
<section class="planning-group"><h3>Welfare facilities</h3><div class="tick-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="welfare" value="Toilets provided"> Toilets</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="welfare" value="Separate male and female toilets provided"> Separate male / female toilets</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="welfare" value="Washing facilities provided"> Washing</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="welfare" value="Drinking water provided"> Drinking water</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="welfare" value="Rest area provided"> Rest area</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="welfare" value="Changing or drying area provided"> Changing / drying area</label></div><input name="welfareDetails" maxlength="400" placeholder="Other welfare arrangements (optional)"></section>
<section class="planning-group"><h3>Waste and environmental controls</h3><div class="tick-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="waste" value="Waste will be segregated"> Waste segregated</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="waste" value="Licensed waste carrier arranged"> Licensed carrier</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="waste" value="Approved disposal site arranged"> Approved disposal site</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="waste" value="Dust and noise controls required"> Dust / noise controls</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="waste" value="Spill kit and spill controls provided"> Spill controls</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="waste" value="Materials will be recycled where possible"> Recycling</label></div><input name="wasteDetails" maxlength="500" placeholder="Waste route, carrier, destination or other controls (optional)"></section>
<section class="planning-group"><h3>Other site conditions</h3><div class="tick-grid"><label><input type="checkbox" name="additionalSite" value="Weather limits apply"> Weather limits</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="additionalSite" value="Restricted working hours apply"> Restricted hours</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="additionalSite" value="Site security requirements apply"> Site security</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="additionalSite" value="Occupied area or public interface"> Occupied / public area</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="additionalSite" value="Customer drawings or specifications apply"> Drawings / specifications</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="additionalSite" value="No other special conditions"> No other conditions</label></div><input name="additionalSiteDetails" maxlength="700" placeholder="Other site or customer requirements (optional)"></section>`;form.querySelector('textarea[name="address"]')?.closest('label')?.after(planningFields);
const permitPicker=planningFields.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('.permit-picker');const permitNote=planningFields.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-permit-selection]');const updatePermitSelection=()=>{const selected=[...planningFields.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="permits"]:checked')].map(input=>input.value);if(permitNote)permitNote.textContent=selected.length?selected.join(', '):'No permits selected';};permitPicker?.addEventListener('change',updatePermitSelection);
const emergencyText=form.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('textarea[name="emergency"]');
if(emergencyText){const fields=document.createElement('fieldset');fields.className='emergency-fields';fields.innerHTML='<legend>Site emergency details</legend><p>Enter confirmed information where available. Blank fields become points to confirm before work starts.</p><div class="emergency-grid"><label>Site emergency contact<input name="siteEmergencyContact" maxlength="150" placeholder="Name / role"></label><label>Contact telephone<input name="siteEmergencyPhone" maxlength="80" type="tel" placeholder="Mobile or site number"></label><label>First aider<input name="firstAider" maxlength="150" placeholder="Name / role"></label><label>First aider telephone<input name="firstAiderPhone" maxlength="80" type="tel" placeholder="Mobile number"></label></div><p class="hospital-title">Nearest hospitals / A&amp;E</p><div class="hospitals">'+[1,2,3].map(n=>'<div class="hospital-row"><strong>'+n+'</strong><input name="hospital'+n+'Name" maxlength="150" placeholder="Hospital name" aria-label="Hospital '+n+' name"><input name="hospital'+n+'Address" maxlength="300" placeholder="Full address and postcode" aria-label="Hospital '+n+' address"><input name="hospital'+n+'Phone" maxlength="80" type="tel" placeholder="Telephone" aria-label="Hospital '+n+' telephone"></div>').join('')+'</div>';emergencyText.parentElement?.replaceWith(fields);}
let payload:Record<string,unknown>={};let price='';
const detailsWarning=document.createElement('div');detailsWarning.className='final-details-warning';detailsWarning.setAttribute('role','note');detailsWarning.innerHTML='<strong>Check every detail before you continue</strong><span>Include all known information about the work, people, equipment, materials, access, site conditions and emergency arrangements. Your paid work pack is created from the details you submit, so missing information will not appear in the downloaded pack.</span>';review.before(detailsWarning);
const packContents=document.querySelector('aside ul');for(const item of ['Toolbox talk and attendance record','Daily site inspection checklist','Accident and injury report','Near-miss and unsafe-condition report','One qualification and training-expiry form per worker']){const entry=document.createElement('li');entry.textContent=item;packContents?.append(entry);}
fetch('/api/safework/checkout').then(r=>r.json()).then(c=>{price=typeof c.amount==='number'?new Intl.NumberFormat('en-GB',{style:'currency',currency:'GBP'}).format(c.amount/100):'';document.querySelector('#price')!.textContent=c.enabled?`${price} total${c.mode==='test'?' — TEST CHECKOUT, no real payment':''}`:'Online sales are not open yet.';review.disabled=!c.enabled;}).catch(()=>{document.querySelector('#price')!.textContent='Availability could not be checked. Please reload.';});
form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const data=new FormData(form);payload=Object.fromEntries(data);const lines=[['Site emergency contact',data.get('siteEmergencyContact'),data.get('siteEmergencyPhone')],['First aider',data.get('firstAider'),data.get('firstAiderPhone')],...[1,2,3].map(n=>['Hospital '+n,data.get('hospital'+n+'Name'),data.get('hospital'+n+'Address'),data.get('hospital'+n+'Phone')])].filter(row=>row.slice(1).some(Boolean)).map(row=>row.filter(Boolean).join(': '));payload.emergency=lines.join('\n');const collect=(name,detailsName)=>{const selected=data.getAll(name).map(String).filter(Boolean);const details=String(data.get(detailsName)||'').trim();return [...selected,...(details?[details]:[])].join('; ');};const planning=[['Work-area approval, boundaries and access',collect('boundaryAccess','boundaryAccessDetails')],['Services and ground checks',collect('servicesGround','servicesGroundDetails')],['Permits and authorisations',collect('permits','permitDetails')],['Worker roles, competence and supervision',collect('peopleRoles','peopleRolesDetails')],['Plant, tools, materials and products',collect('plantMaterials','plantMaterialsDetails')],['Welfare',collect('welfare','welfareDetails')],['Waste and environmental controls',collect('waste','wasteDetails')],['Other site conditions and requirements',collect('additionalSite','additionalSiteDetails')]].filter(([,value])=>String(value||'').trim()).map(([label,value])=>`${label}: ${value}`).join('\n');payload.description=`${data.get('description')}\n\nCONFIRMED PLANNING ANSWERS:\n${planning}`;payload.reviewAccepted=data.has('reviewAccepted');payload.processingAccepted=data.has('processingAccepted');document.querySelector('#summary')!.textContent=`Company: ${data.get('company')}\nWorkers: ${data.get('workerCount')}\nJob: ${data.get('description')}\nAddress: ${data.get('address')}\n\nPlanning answers:\n${planning}\n\nEmergency details: ${payload.emergency || 'Customer has not supplied emergency details'}`;document.querySelector('#total')!.textContent=`Total: ${price} for one draft work pack.`;form.hidden=true;confirmation.hidden=false;confirmation.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});});
document.querySelector('#edit')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{form.hidden=false;confirmation.hidden=true;});
pay.addEventListener('click',async()=>{pay.disabled=true;msg.textContent='Opening your order…';try{const r=await fetch('/api/safework/checkout',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error);const link=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#order-link')!;link.href=d.returnUrl;const stripe=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#stripe-link')!;stripe.href=d.url;document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#recovery')!.hidden=false;confirmation.hidden=true;msg.textContent='Order saved. Keep your private link, then continue to Stripe.';}catch(e){msg.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Checkout failed.';pay.disabled=false;}});
</script>
<style>
body{background:#f4f6f2;color:#17392d}.workspace{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:35px 22px 70px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:30px}h1{font-size:38px;line-height:1.15}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:32px}form,aside,#confirmation,#recovery{background:white;border:1px solid #d5dfd6;border-radius:8px;padding:26px}aside{align-self:start}label{display:block;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:18px}label span{font-weight:400}input:not([type=checkbox]),textarea{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #aebeb2;border-radius:4px;font:inherit;margin-top:6px}textarea{resize:vertical}.check{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:400}.check input{margin-top:5px}button,.button{background:#17392d;color:white;padding:13px 20px;border:0;border-radius:4px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;display:inline-block}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.secondary{background:#e2eadf;color:#17392d}#price{font-size:24px;font-weight:800}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font:inherit;overflow-wrap:anywhere}[hidden]{display:none!important}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b18123;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:720px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workspace{padding:24px 16px}h1{font-size:30px}form,aside{padding:20px}}
.purchase-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:28px 0 14px}.purchase-steps li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);font-weight:800}.purchase-steps strong{display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f58220;color:#07111f}.payment-notice{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;margin:0 0 24px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #f2a55f;border-radius:8px;background:#fff7ed;color:#7c2d12}.aside-tag{margin:0;color:#9a4200;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.locked-pack{display:grid;gap:3px;margin-top:20px;padding:14px;border-radius:7px;background:#edf2f5}.locked-pack span{font-size:13px;color:#536579}@media(max-width:720px){.purchase-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.payment-notice{display:grid}}
.emergency-fields{margin:24px 0;padding:20px;border:1px solid #c9d7cc;border-radius:8px}.emergency-fields legend{padding:0 8px;color:#176b50;font-size:22px;font-weight:850}.emergency-fields>p{color:#53675e;font-size:14px}.emergency-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 16px}.hospital-title{margin-top:4px;font-weight:800}.hospitals{display:grid;gap:10px}.hospital-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px 1fr 1.6fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:10px}.hospital-row strong{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#e9f4ee;color:#176b50}.hospital-row input{margin:0!important}@media(max-width:720px){.emergency-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hospital-row{grid-template-columns:26px 1fr}.hospital-row input{grid-column:2}}
.planning-fields{margin:24px 0;padding:20px;border:2px solid #f2a55f;border-radius:8px;background:#fffaf5}.planning-fields legend{padding:0 8px;color:#9a4200;font-size:22px;font-weight:850}.planning-fields>p{margin-top:0;color:#6b5547;font-size:14px}.planning-fields label{margin-bottom:16px}.planning-fields label:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

body{background:#07111f url('/images/safework-office-background.png') center top / cover fixed no-repeat;color:#10243b}
.workspace{max-width:1180px;min-height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(7,17,31,.78),rgba(7,17,31,.55));padding:44px 40px 80px}
.workspace>h1,.workspace>a,.workspace>.eyebrow,.workspace>p{color:#fff}.workspace>.eyebrow{color:#ffb66e}.workspace>p{max-width:760px}
form,aside,#confirmation,#recovery{background:#fff;border-color:#dce3eb;box-shadow:0 16px 40px #0003;border-radius:10px}aside{border-top:4px solid #f58220}
button,.button{background:#f58220;color:#07111f}.secondary{background:#e7edf3;color:#10243b}
input:not([type=checkbox]),textarea{background:#fafbfd;color:#10243b;border-color:#a9b7c5}
@media(max-width:720px){body{background-attachment:scroll}.workspace{padding:28px 16px 50px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.72)}}

:global(body.safework-office){background-color:#07111f;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(7,17,31,.48),rgba(7,17,31,.48)),url('/images/safework-office-background.png');background-size:auto, max(100vw,1200px) auto;background-position:center top;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll}
:global(body.safework-office main){background:transparent}
:global(body.safework-office>header),:global(body.safework-office>footer){background:rgba(7,17,31,.76);border:0}
:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-brand),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-links),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-bottom),:global(body.safework-office footer li),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list p){border:0;box-shadow:none}
:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-links){background:transparent}
.hero,.advice{background:rgba(7,17,31,.48)}
.hero .lead,.advice p:not(.eyebrow){color:#fff}

:global(html){min-height:100%;background:#07111f}
:global(body.safework-office){position:relative;isolation:isolate;background:none}
:global(body.safework-office)::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(rgba(7,17,31,.65),rgba(7,17,31,.65)),url('/images/safework-office-background.png') center center / cover no-repeat}
:global(body.safework-office>header),:global(body.safework-office>footer),:global(body.safework-office main),.hero,.advice,.workspace{background:transparent}
</style>
<style is:global>
  body.safework-office .workspace{width:min(1720px,calc(100% - 48px))}
  body.safework-office .layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  body.safework-office .layout>aside{order:-1;position:static;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(280px,360px);column-gap:42px;align-items:start;padding:28px 34px}
  body.safework-office .layout>aside .aside-tag,body.safework-office .layout>aside h2,body.safework-office .layout>aside ul{grid-column:1}
  body.safework-office .layout>aside h2{margin:7px 0 12px}
  body.safework-office .layout>aside ul{columns:3;column-gap:34px;margin:0;padding-left:20px}
  body.safework-office .layout>aside li{break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:6px}
  body.safework-office .layout>aside #price{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;margin:0;font-size:25px}
  body.safework-office .layout>aside>p:not(.aside-tag):not(#price),body.safework-office .layout>aside .locked-pack{grid-column:2;margin-top:12px}
  body.safework-office #pack-form{width:100%}
  @media(max-width:1100px){body.safework-office .layout>aside{grid-template-columns:1fr}body.safework-office .layout>aside>*{grid-column:1!important;grid-row:auto!important}body.safework-office .layout>aside ul{columns:2}}
  @media(max-width:720px){body.safework-office .workspace{width:100%}body.safework-office .layout>aside ul{columns:1}}
</style>
<style is:global>
  body.safework-office .workspace{width:min(1540px,calc(100% - 48px));max-width:none;padding:52px 48px 90px}
  body.safework-office .workspace>p{max-width:920px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6}
  body.safework-office .workspace>h1{font-size:48px}
  body.safework-office .layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2.2fr) minmax(310px,.8fr);gap:36px;align-items:start}
  body.safework-office #pack-form{padding:38px 42px}
  body.safework-office #pack-form>h2{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 28px}
  body.safework-office #pack-form>label{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:22px}
  body.safework-office #pack-form input:not([type=checkbox]),body.safework-office #pack-form textarea{min-height:54px;padding:15px 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;border-radius:7px}
  body.safework-office #pack-form>label>textarea[name=description]{min-height:210px}
